      "support_status": "SUFFICIENT",
      "rationale": "P026 states the potential masking effect of persistent backlogs; P009 identifies the comparison whose response is being interpreted."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C039.signal_basis",
    "value": "Compare missing-attachment frequency across comparable covered orders before and after responsibility becomes explicit, using consistent inspection intervals. The proposed signal is a reduction, repeated across comparable periods if volume permits; interpretation must distinguish new orders from backlog repairs.",
    "scope": "Prospective attachment-frequency comparison following clarification of responsibility.",
